WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE Simulated excerpt: a synthesized voice reading text written for the demo. CloudBridge Summit 2026 is a fictional event.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
[Simulated excerpt: synthesized voice, fictional speaker]

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>Let me show you the morning our AI SRE agent got it wrong.

3
00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.540
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>At six twelve, the checkout latency alarm fired.

4
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>Within forty seconds the agent had a diagnosis: the primary database was saturated,

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.980
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>and it proposed a failover. It wrote a confident summary, with graphs.

6
00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.040
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>The database was fine.

7
00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.040
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>What the agent had seen was a jump in connection errors.

8
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.320
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>What it had ignored was a config push nine minutes earlier

9
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:31.620
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>that set the connection pool to zero on three of our twelve pods.

10
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:36.100
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>The failover would have cost us about nine minutes of write downtime, for nothing.

11
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.160
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>The guardrail that caught it was boring, and that is the point.

12
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:44.160
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>Every change the agent proposes becomes a pull request with evidence links,

13
00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.900
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>and a human has to approve it.

14
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:50.440
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>Our on-call engineer opened the first link, saw that the errors came from three pods only,

15
00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.640
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>and rejected the fix in one click.

16
00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.860
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>So here is my checklist.

17
00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.700
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>Demand evidence links, not summaries. Keep every change reviewable.

18
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.220
<v Daniel Kowalczyk>And make it cheap for a human to say no.
